; The CompCert Asm.program -> Normalized_ast adapter (next.md "the direct
; CompCert integration", Order item 2 - aarch64 return42 only).
;
; Gated exactly like asm/melange/* (see asm/melange/dune): depending on
; compcert_aarch64 unconditionally would require compcert-lib-build-aarch64's
; Rocq-extracted output on OCAMLPATH for every `dune build @all`/`@runtest`,
; breaking make asm-build/asm-test/asm-ci's "neither Rocq nor a cross
; toolchain" guarantee. ASM_COMPCERT_ADAPTER is set explicitly by the new
; asm-compcert-adapter-test Makefile target, never left to a default.
;
; compcert_aarch64 is resolved via OCAMLPATH (an installed dune package from
; ../../compcert-lib-aarch64, a separate dune project/workspace - see that
; project's src/dune), not via a shared dune-workspace: none exists in this
; repo, and introducing one would relocate asm/'s _build directory, which
; several Makefile targets and scripts hard-code the path of.

(library
 (name compcert_adapter)
 (modules adapter test_adapter)
 (modes byte native)
 (libraries compcert_aarch64 foundation asm_core aarch64 test_coherence fmt)
 (inline_tests)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_expect))
 (enabled_if
  (= %{env:ASM_COMPCERT_ADAPTER=false} true)))
